@startuml 会话握手时序图
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE9FB
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontColor #1F2933
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title 有状态 MCP 会话:握手 → 工具调用 → 反向请求

participant "Client (Host)" as C
participant "Server" as S

== 握手阶段(协商能力 + 建立会话) ==

C -> S  : ① initialize {protocolVersion, capabilities}
S --> C : ② initialize result {protocolVersion, capabilities, Mcp-Session-Id: abc123}
C -> S  : ③ initialized (notification)

note over C, S
  服务器在内存中创建会话对象,绑定 session_id
  双方记住对方的能力(后续请求不再重复声明)
end note

== 握手结束,会话建立 ==

C -> S  : ④ tools/call  (Header: Mcp-Session-Id: abc123)
S --> C : ⑤ result

== 服务器可主动发起反向请求(依赖长连接保持开放) ==

S -> C  : ⑥ sampling / createRequest (elicitation 追问 / 采样)
C -> S  : ⑦ sampling result

note right of S
  反向请求要求底层连接
  全程保持开放(held-open stream)
  → 这是水平扩展的核心障碍之一
end note

@enduml
